\.DS_Store
# Codex rewrites config.toml on every session -- trust levels, hook hashes, nux
# counters, build-pinned plugin paths. A symlink here would put that churn (and
# every project path visited) into git, so the tracked copy is a reference to
# merge by hand, not a link. AGENTS.md is hand-written and does get stowed.
# Stow anchors ignore patterns itself, so no ^ or $ here.
\.codex/config\.toml
